          "exampleId": "w:factor#e-e1d2dee03e48a927",
          "text": "And the more we look, the more we will see that social factors(因素)like gender, race, and class do not determine the appearance of genius.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2021-national-a",
            "paperTitle": "2021年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（全国甲卷）",
