        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:factor#e-9316f03911ed7c1b",
          "text": "Harmless by itself, isoprene interacts rapidly with polluting nitrogen oxides released by vehicles, buildings and industry to form ground-level ozone（臭氧）—a major factor in many breathing problems.",
